      "severity": "HIGH",
      "title": "Body field 'username' reaches a database query unsafely (injection)",
      "endpoint": "POST /login",
      "detail": "Sending the body field 'username' as \"apifuzz'\" (a value with one extra quote) was answered HTTP 500 with a database error in the body, confirmed on a second request. The quote reached the query engine unescaped, so the value is placed into the query text rather than bound as a parameter. This was detected by a database error; no data was read or changed.",
